                     /gene="sspA"
                     /locus_tag="ABO_0581"
                     /function="forms an equimolar complex with the rna
                     polymerase holoenzyme (rnap) but not with the core enzyme,
                     it is synthesized predominantly when cells are exposed to
                     amino acid starvation, at which time it accounts for over
                     5046f the total protein synthesized. it is involved in the
                     transition from p1 early to p1 late gene expression. rnk
                     and sspa can functionally replace p.aeruginosa alginate
                     regulatory gene algr2."
