                     catalyzed by nqrf, which accepts electrons from nadh and
                     reduces ubiquinone-1 to ubisemiquinone by a one-electron
                     transfer pathway (by similarity). nadh + ubiquinone +
                     na(+)(in) = nad(+) + ubiquinol + na(+)(out)."
                     /note="uses the energy from reduction of ubiquinone-1 to
                     ubiquinol to move Na(+) ions from the cytoplasm to the
                     periplasm"
