     CDS             complement(2901941..2903182)
                     /gene="nnrS"
                     /locus_tag="ABO_2561"
                     /function="Uncharacterized protein involved in response to
                     NO"
                     /note="NnrS protein. pfam05940, This family consists of
                     several bacterial NnrS like proteins. NnrS is a  heme-Cu
                     protein and a member of the short-chain dehydrogenase
                     family. Expression of nnrS is dependent on the
                     transcriptional regulator NnrR, which also regulates
                     expression of genes required for the reduction of nitrite
                     to nitrous oxide, including nirK and nor. NnrS is a
                     haem-and copper-containing membrane protein. Genes
                     encoding  orthologues of NnrS are sometimes but not always
                     found in bacteria encoding nitrite and/or nitric oxide
                     reductase"
                     /codon_start=1
